{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfyCbq52zfX72EwuvGjX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For tetrahedral Ni²⁺ in ZnO I get **Dq ≈ 515 cm⁻¹** (so 10Dq ≈ 5 150 cm⁻¹) and **B ≈ 790 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**Approach**\n\nA tetrahedral d⁸ ion behaves like an octahedral d², with the same energy formulas but the sign of Dq reversed. The ground term is ³T₁(F), and both observed bands are triplet-to-triplet transitions. The two ³T₁ terms (from ³F and ³P) mix, which gives these energies:\n\n- To ³T₂: ν₁ = 5Dq − 7.5B + ½R\n- To ³A₂: ν₂ = 15Dq − 7.5B + ½R\n- To ³T₁(P): ν₃ = R\n\nHere R = (225B² + 100Dq² + 180·Dq·B)^½.\n\n**Solving with the two bands**\n\n1. The ³T₁(2) band gives R directly: R = ν₃ = 15 500 cm⁻¹.\n2. Put R into the ³T₂ equation: 4 400 = 5Dq − 7.5B + 7 750. This gives 5Dq − 7.5B = −3 350, so Dq = 1.5B − 670.\n3. Substitute Dq into R² = 15 500²: 720B² − 321 600B − 195 360 000 = 0.\n4. The positive root is B ≈ 790 cm⁻¹. Then Dq = 1.5 × 790 − 670 ≈ 515 cm⁻¹.\n\n**Checks**\n\n- The model predicts the ³A₂ band at about 9 550 cm⁻¹.\n- B is about 76% of the free-ion value for Ni²⁺ (about 1 040 cm⁻¹). That fits the covalent bonding expected in an oxide.\n\n**About C**\n\nSpin-allowed triplet-to-triplet energies do not depend on C, so the data cannot determine it. The value C ≈ 4.5 × 790 ≈ 3 560 cm⁻¹ comes only from the assumed ratio C/B = 4.5.\n\n{\"Dq\": 515, \"B\": 790, \"C\": 3555, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Solved both spin-allowed triplet band energies for tetrahedral d8 (d2-analogue) Dq and B; C is taken from the assumed C/B = 4.5.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1698,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1698,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb488312-b355-4a75-94f3-2354e92e093b","uuid":"9fdec7d0-5287-4c1d-9806-99a379cc8bd9","timestamp":"2026-11-03T12:09:45.624Z","request_id":"req_011CgfyCbTjzL7Hv7ChhfnST"}
